WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Kneel and interlace the fingers, forearms on the floor, elbows shoulder-width.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Place the crown of the head down, cradled by the hands.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lift the hips and walk the feet in, then float the legs up.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Stack hips over shoulders; press firmly through the forearms.
